Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato. 21 TL
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:18.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What the heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{opening}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,"…The Footsteps of Spring."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:02.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.51,0:02:04.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who did you give your chocolate to, Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.14,0:02:07.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.56,0:02:07.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.31,0:02:11.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I gave it to…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:15.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei, Ioryogi-san, Toshihiko-kun…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.86,0:02:17.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.36,0:02:20.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Who did you give your number one chocolate to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.70,0:02:26.25,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I like everyone, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:29.79,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.79,0:02:31.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.67,0:02:36.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to butt in on your fun, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.18,0:02:44.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t get so worked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.97,0:02:47.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Could you call Sayaka over for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:50.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.65,0:02:53.52,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve come to talk things over with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:02:57.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,For the final time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You can’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:02.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You won’t move, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.66,0:03:03.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I will not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.95,0:03:10.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s a problem. {Keeper: orig line "What a problem."}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.04,0:03:14.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:18.38,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let him through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:23.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s been a while, Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.89,0:03:32.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.10,0:03:35.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just wait a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.61,0:03:38.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,A little longer? For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.65,0:03:41.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I think I’ve waited quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:47.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why… did you change so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.79,0:03:50.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn’t change.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:53.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This is how I originally was.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:57.96,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.92,0:04:02.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just give it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:04.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you trying to act tough because I’m here? {Keeper: orig line "Are you playing strong because I’m here?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.22,0:04:08.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If that’s so, you’re going about this the wrong way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:13.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re little more than a stranger to me, now. {Keeper: orig line "I only think of you as a stranger now."}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:25.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why you don’t have any\Nother choice, now that I’m here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.74,0:04:33.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Or do you want the preschool to be\Ndestroyed, right in front of the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:38.50,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t have to be so obsessed with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.50,0:04:42.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just start another preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:43.51,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.47,0:04:47.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You know it better than anyone! {Keeper: orig line "You’re the one who knows most!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:48.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.80,0:04:51.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This preschool isn’t just some building! {building = literally box}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:53.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s what she inherited from the late principal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:55.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s really precious! {Keeper: Not very fond of this line | orig line "It’s really precious!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.35,0:04:57.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It can’t just be replaced! {Keeper: orig line "There’s no replacement for it!"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.15,0:05:01.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If it’s not just a building, then\Nwhat are you trying to protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:05.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you saying this building is more important than the children?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.04,0:05:16.04,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you’re fine with the children becoming victims, then stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:23.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But you should probably take a look at your priorities. {Keeper: Thanks IT, heh| orig line "But then you’ll be mistaking the cause for the end."}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.46,0:05:24.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You…!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:27.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.89,0:05:35.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Laying a hand on me will probably just hasten the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:43.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll close the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.66,0:05:51.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:56.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,In return, please wait until the graduation ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:09.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Dobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.97,0:06:12.01,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:14.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Look here…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.27,0:06:21.65,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re getting the sheets wet right after they’ve dried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:25.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:27.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Geez…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:30.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re giving us more work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.61,0:06:32.45,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:43.54,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to go to Okiura’s place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.00,0:06:45.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And do what? {Keeper: orig line "What can you do by going there? "}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:50.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to ask him again to not tear down the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.30,0:06:54.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you go, you’ll just make things more complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.14,0:06:56.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But at this rate…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:58.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just don’t go, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:13.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:16.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:21.87,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did he suddenly show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.87,0:07:24.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’s the point in asking now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.75,0:07:27.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re threatening her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.21,0:07:29.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If she wanted to, she could sue. {Keeper: err… or call the cops?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.42,0:07:33.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If she could, she would’ve done so long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.47,0:07:35.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:38.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She decided herself that she’d shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.72,0:07:41.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit the blabbing and just leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:43.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I won’t give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.81,0:07:45.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll protect that preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:46.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And how will you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:52.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What an idiot, you don’t even know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:56.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:58.70,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’re not done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.66,0:08:02.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You act all cool, saying you’ll protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:06.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you think talking to me will do anything, you’ve got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.21,0:08:08.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:12.13,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Our president{CEO} was the one who had his eyes on the preschool in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:13.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,President?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:15.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura-san’s father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:18.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The debt owed by Yomogi Preschool
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:24.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,was passed down from the previous principal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.39,0:08:25.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:27.31,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:33.32,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,The principal got caught up in those\Nmoney deals and died from the stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.70,0:08:35.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Knowing that…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.74,0:08:38.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…it’s as much that guy’s fault for doing whatever his father tells him to! {Keeper: orig line "Knowing that, that guy’s as much of an accomplice"}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:38.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:41.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why I’m saying you don’t know anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.41,0:08:44.46,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t you know what would happen if the president actually got serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.50,0:08:51.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why Okiura-san said he’d settle it himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.76,0:08:52.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.77,0:09:11.86,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I believe Okiura-san took on the role of the villain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:15.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,in order to protect the preschool from the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:21.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even more so, I think he did it\Nto protect the woman he loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.45,0:09:26.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of nonsense is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.37,0:09:29.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You’re free to think whatever you like of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:30.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.26,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:36.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I owe her a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:41.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why we don’t want to\Ncause an uproar and hurt her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.93,0:09:47.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Just do what Okiura says.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{…ue wa nandemo mieru}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{sagasou sagasou atarashii fushigi}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.07,0:10:06.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…top, we can see it as much as we’d like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.62,0:10:16.63,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let us search, let us search, for a new mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.85,0:10:26.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,All of the other preschools are full.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.39,0:10:29.06,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m on a waiting list myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.06,0:10:31.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m so sorry it’s come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.25,0:10:56.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Here, eat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:59.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What’s this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.34,0:11:02.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you’d like, would you eat dinner with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:05.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You won’t be lonely if you eat with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.22,0:11:07.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chise-chan…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:17.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, I appreciate the thought, but I can’t eat this…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:23.03,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:27.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No one would have an appetite at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.54,0:11:29.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,No, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:36.34,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’m really happy that you thought of me. {Keeper: orig line "I’m really happy for all of your consideration."}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:45.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Father, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:49.72,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn’t protect the preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:53.10,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But even so…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.10,0:11:59.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…I still want to believe in him\Nsomewhere deep down in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:02.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Quite the fool, aren’t I? {Keeper: orig line "Aren’t I a fool?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:13.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose-san, I saw Okiura-san at the preschool today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.92,0:12:17.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He looked really lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.17,0:12:20.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I see…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:23.80,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He was the one who told us to leave…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.47,0:12:29.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura-san probably still loves Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.93,0:12:33.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And Sayaka still has feelings for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.39,0:12:40.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then why is Okiura-san doing things to make her sad?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:43.61,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if people love each other… {Keeper: It sounds to me like she’s making a generalisation| orig line "Even if they love each other…"}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.65,0:12:46.95,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if they treasure each other…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.53,0:12:50.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,There are times when they have to go different ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,00 eyecatch}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:28.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:32.91,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If I follow him, I might find Okiura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.91,0:13:33.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.83,0:13:40.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.97,0:13:48.59,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let me see Okiura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.59,0:13:51.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Miss, just give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:52.97,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:13:58.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,It’s pointless even if you meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.81,0:13:59.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.65,0:14:02.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:14.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Send her away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:18.41,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I do, I don’t think she’ll back off so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.29,0:14:21.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Then leave her be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:43.48,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She’s still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.73,0:14:46.07,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.36,0:14:56.33,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Every one of them… Why are they so taken in by that preschool?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:04.21,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san, are you cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.42,0:15:06.75,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I’m cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:11.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don’t you find an umbrella, or a place to take shelter from the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.05,0:15:12.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Think a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.64,0:15:17.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But then if Okiura-san looks outside that window,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.56,0:15:20.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,he won’t see that I’m here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:23.23,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He won’t come out if you do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:25.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’ll come out sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.69,0:15:27.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If not today, then maybe tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.19,0:15:30.53,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If not tomorrow, then maybe the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.45,0:15:33.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you planning to wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:38.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Until that man comes out, I’ll keep waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.31,0:16:07.27,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you going to be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:10.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:11.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Um…!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:14.66,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I’ve got nothing to speak with you about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:16.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We’ll take down the preschool,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.57,0:16:19.08,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,and the property value will go towards the debt payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.08,0:16:21.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’ll settle everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:30.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to ask about something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:37.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to ask about how you really feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.76,0:16:39.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Like I said, the preschool is…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.35,0:16:40.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s not it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:43.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What a troublesome girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.85,0:16:47.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose-san said that…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:51.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,…Okiura-san, you still have feelings for Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And Sayaka-sensei still…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.86,0:16:57.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,She still loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.79,0:17:04.00,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I was wondering what you were going to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.00,0:17:05.12,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.71,0:17:09.29,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura-san, if you still treasure Sayaka-sensei,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:11.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,why are you doing such cruel things?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:19.47,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even though we loved it…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.31,0:17:23.43,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:24.98,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Me…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:26.44,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.40,0:17:29.69,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone at Yomogi Preschool…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.82,0:17:33.15,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,We all loved that place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:36.24,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.70,0:17:38.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,So…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:42.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I think you did it to protect Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:44.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Even so…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:49.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You took Yomogi Preschool from Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.63,0:17:53.17,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You made Sayaka-sensei sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:59.55,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t think of you as a good person because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.80,0:18:06.02,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But even if you aren’t a good person,\Nif you’re important to Sayaka-sensei…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.35,0:18:07.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Things can’t stay like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.61,0:18:16.11,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.08,0:18:33.84,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, our worlds were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.63,0:18:38.76,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn’t hold back my father’s power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:43.85,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why this is the only way I can protect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.81,0:18:50.60,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t hate Sayaka-sensei, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:57.28,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You still hold her precious, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.57,0:19:03.37,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:26.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:29.39,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:31.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn’t sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:33.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.61,0:19:35.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.02,0:19:41.90,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s doing all the dirty work just to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.37,0:19:45.78,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-kun, what are you talking abo{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:46.99,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Okiura.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.29,0:19:56.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:19:58.42,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,B-But…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:01.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn’t mean I can forgive him…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:02.93,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,What’re you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:07.05,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don’t forgive him, the only thing he can do is disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.05,0:20:08.56,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.31,0:20:15.94,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,I… want you to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.23,0:20:19.57,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He’s the only one who can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.23,0:20:24.82,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,That’s why you need to be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:27.20,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.59,0:20:45.30,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness, you’re awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.76,0:20:49.35,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.81,0:20:52.73,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,You were standing for a long time in the rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:21:03.36,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, everyone’s always been protecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.36,0:21:06.49,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, Fujimoto-kun…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:09.74,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,And that man…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.25,0:21:13.62,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Where’s Okiura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.08,0:21:15.83,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,He just left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.83,0:21:17.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay with things being this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:23.88,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.55,0:21:28.18,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,If you still think Okiura-san is precious to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.89,0:21:31.89,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Chase him down and hug him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.68,0:21:33.77,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.67,0:22:45.71,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,This won’t do…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.30,0:22:50.09,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t forget your wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,{ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.22,0:00:00.22,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,"…Day of Farewell."
